annotation-ref"},{"text":"空自许，镜中衰鬓已先斑。\n\n出师一表真名世","type":"text"},{"label":"[8]","noteId":"footnote-10369-8","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，千载谁堪伯仲间","type":"text"},{"label":"[9]","noteId":"footnote-10369-9","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"！","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"收复失地的宿志不得实现，而国土沦陷的愤懑却一如既往。诗人回忆起夜雪战船、秋风铁马的过去，想起自我期许的落空、失地收复的无望。通过感叹诸葛亮出师雄文，暗示朝野上下都是主降的碌碌小人。全诗感情沉郁，气韵浑厚，尤以颔联“楼船”“铁马”两句，雄放豪迈，为人们广泛传诵。诵读此诗，应体会诗作内容与诗人亲身经历的关系，理解“书愤”的丰富内涵。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e5%8f%a4%e8%af%97%e8%af%8d%e8%af%b5%e8%af%bb/%e4%b9%a6%e6%84%a4-%e9%99%86%e6%b8%b8","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e5%8f%a4%e8%af%97%e8%af%8d%e8%af%b5%e8%af%bb/%e4%b9%a6%e6%84%a4-%e9%99%86%e6%b8%b8","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e5%8f%a4%e8%af%97%e8%af%8d%e8%af%b5%e8%af%bb/%e4%b9%a6%e6%84%a4-%e9%99%86%e6%b8%b8","title":null}],"media":[],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":10369,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"0319bd9f7623eb57ee396cafc0343cb6c4dc51dce258109a19edbdddd91be71c","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-08-09.1","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10369-1","postId":10369,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10369-1","text":"[1]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10369-2","postId":10369,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10369-2","text":"[2]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10369-3","postId":10369,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10369-3","text":"[3]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10369-4","